  "notes": "LED wash moving head: pan 540 degrees, tilt 270 degrees, a master dimmer, a strobe channel and red, green, blue and white emitters. The 8ch Mode has one byte for pan and for tilt, the 10ch Mode two. The strobe channel is taken as linear from off to 30 Hz; check a real unit's chart before trusting the rate.",
